{"id":"mahabharata-3-007","work":"mahabharata","part":3,"partName":"आरण्यकपर्व","partNameEn":"Aranyaka Parva","unit":7,"title":"सप्तमोऽध्यायः","titleEn":"Adhyaya 7 · Vidura is recalled","summary":{"en":"Dhritarashtra soon regrets sending Vidura away and faints with grief. He sends Sanjaya to bring him back; Vidura returns, and the brothers are reconciled.","kn":"ವಿದುರನನ್ನು ಕಳುಹಿಸಿದ್ದಕ್ಕೆ ಧೃತರಾಷ್ಟ್ರನು ಬೇಗನೆ ಪಶ್ಚಾತ್ತಾಪಪಟ್ಟು ದುಃಖದಿಂದ ಮೂರ್ಛಿತನಾಗುತ್ತಾನೆ. ಅವನನ್ನು ಕರೆತರಲು ಸಂಜಯನನ್ನು ಕಳುಹಿಸುತ್ತಾನೆ; ವಿದುರನು ಮರಳುತ್ತಾನೆ, ಸಹೋದರರು ಸಮಾಧಾನಗೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾರೆ.","hi":"धृतराष्ट्र शीघ्र ही विदुर को भेजने पर पछताते हैं और शोक से मूर्च्छित हो जाते हैं। वे संजय को उन्हें लाने भेजते हैं; विदुर लौटते हैं, और दोनों भाइयों में मेल हो जाता है।","te":"విదురుని పంపినందుకు ధృతరాష్ట్రుడు త్వరలోనే పశ్చాత్తాపపడి దుఃఖంతో మూర్ఛపోతాడు. అతనిని తీసుకురావడానికి సంజయుని పంపుతాడు; విదురుడు తిరిగివస్తాడు, సోదరులు సమాధానపడతారు.","ta":"விதுரரை அனுப்பியதற்காகத் திருதராஷ்டிரன் விரைவில் வருந்தித் துயரத்தால் மயங்குகிறான். அவரை அழைத்து வர ஸஞ்ஜயனை அனுப்ப, விதுரர் திரும்புகிறார்; சகோதரர்கள் இணக்கம் அடைகிறார்கள்.","ml":"വിദുരനെ അയച്ചതിൽ ധൃതരാഷ്ട്രൻ താമസിയാതെ ഖേദിച്ച് ദുഃഖത്താൽ മൂർച്ഛിക്കുന്നു. അദ്ദേഹം സഞ്ജയനെ അയച്ച് വിദുരനെ തിരികെ വിളിക്കുന്നു; വിദുരൻ മടങ്ങിയെത്തുന്നു, സഹോദരന്മാർ അനുരഞ്ജനത്തിലാകുന്നു."},"source":"Mahabharata, Critical Edition (BORI, Pune) 3.7; e-text by M. Tokunaga and J. D. Smith, © BORI 1999, version of Mon Apr 11 2022","sections":[{"title":"आरण्यकपर्व","titleEn":"Aranyaka Parva (Into the forest)","verses":[{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":1,"text":"गते तु विदुरे राजन्नाश्रमं पाण्डवान्प्रति ।\nधृतराष्ट्रो महाप्राज्ञः पर्यतप्यत भारत ॥","meaning":{"en":"When Vidura had gone to the hermitage of the Pandavas, king, the very wise Dhritarashtra was racked with remorse, descendant of Bharata."}},{"n":2,"text":"स सभाद्वारमागम्य विदुरस्मारमोहितः ।\nसमक्षं पार्थिवेन्द्राणां पपाताविष्टचेतनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Reaching the door of the assembly hall, bewildered by his remembrance of Vidura, he collapsed senseless in front of the lords of the earth."}},{"n":3,"text":"स तु लब्ध्वा पुनः संज्ञां समुत्थाय महीतलात् ।\nसमीपोपस्थितं राजा संजयं वाक्यमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Regaining consciousness, the king rose from the ground and spoke to Sanjaya, who stood near."}},{"n":4,"text":"भ्राता मम सुहृच्चैव साक्षाद्धर्म इवापरः ।\nतस्य स्मृत्वाद्य सुभृशं हृदयं दीर्यतीव मे ॥","meaning":{"en":"My brother and friend, like a second Dharma in person: remembering him, my heart seems to split open."}},{"n":5,"text":"तमानयस्व धर्मज्ञं मम भ्रातरमाशु वै ।\nइति ब्रुवन्स नृपतिः करुणं पर्यदेवयत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Bring him quickly, my brother who knows dharma. So saying, the king lamented piteously."}},{"n":6,"text":"पश्चात्तापाभिसंतप्तो विदुरस्मारकर्शितः ।\nभ्रातृस्नेहादिदं राजन्संजयं वाक्यमब्रवीत् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Scorched by regret, wasted by his longing for Vidura, he spoke from brotherly love to Sanjaya, king."}},{"n":7,"text":"गच्छ संजय जानीहि भ्रातरं विदुरं मम ।\nयदि जीवति रोषेण मया पापेन निर्धुतः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Go, Sanjaya, and find out whether my brother Vidura is alive, he whom I, wicked, cast out in anger."}},{"n":8,"text":"न हि तेन मम भ्रात्रा सुसूक्ष्ममपि किंचन ।\nव्यलीकं कृतपूर्वं मे प्राज्ञेनामितबुद्धिना ॥","meaning":{"en":"That wise brother of mine, of boundless intelligence, never did me the slightest wrong before."}},{"n":9,"text":"स व्यलीकं कथं प्राप्तो मत्तः परमबुद्धिमान् ।\nन जह्याज्जीवितं प्राज्ञस्तं गच्छानय संजय ॥","meaning":{"en":"How could he, so very wise, have been wronged by me in my folly? Go and bring him, Sanjaya, lest that wise man give up his life."}},{"n":10,"text":"तस्य तद्वचनं श्रुत्वा राज्ञस्तमनुमान्य च ।\nसंजयो बाढमित्युक्त्वा प्राद्रवत्काम्यकं वनम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Hearing the king's words and honoring them, Sanjaya said \"So be it\" and hurried to the Kamyaka forest."}},{"n":11,"text":"सोऽचिरेण समासाद्य तद्वनं यत्र पाण्डवाः ।\nरौरवाजिनसंवीतं ददर्शाथ युधिष्ठिरम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Soon he reached the forest where the Pandavas were, and saw Yudhishthira dressed in black antelope skin."}},{"n":12,"text":"विदुरेण सहासीनं ब्राह्मणैश्च सहस्रशः ।\nभ्रातृभिश्चाभिसंगुप्तं देवैरिव शतक्रतुम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"He was seated with Vidura and thousands of Brahmins, guarded by his brothers as Indra by the gods."}},{"n":13,"text":"युधिष्ठिरमथाभ्येत्य पूजयामास संजयः ।\nभीमार्जुनयमांश्चापि तदर्हं प्रत्यपद्यत ॥","meaning":{"en":"Approaching Yudhishthira, Sanjaya paid him honor, and received due courtesy from Bhima, Arjuna and the twins."}},{"n":14,"text":"राज्ञा पृष्टः स कुशलं सुखासीनश्च संजयः ।\nशशंसागमने हेतुमिदं चैवाब्रवीद्वचः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Asked about his welfare by the king, Sanjaya sat at ease and told the reason for his coming, and spoke these words."}},{"n":15,"text":"राजा स्मरति ते क्षत्तर्धृतराष्ट्रोऽम्बिकासुतः ।\nतं पश्य गत्वा त्वं क्षिप्रं संजीवय च पार्थिवम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"King Dhritarashtra, Ambika's son, remembers you, Vidura. Go to him quickly and revive the king."}},{"n":16,"text":"सोऽनुमान्य नरश्रेष्ठान्पाण्डवान्कुरुनन्दनान् ।\nनियोगाद्राजसिंहस्य गन्तुमर्हसि मानद ॥","meaning":{"en":"Taking leave of the Pandavas, best of men and joy of the Kurus, you should go at the lion-king's command, giver of honor."}},{"n":17,"text":"एवमुक्तस्तु विदुरो धीमान्स्वजनवत्सलः ।\nयुधिष्ठिरस्यानुमते पुनरायाद्गजाह्वयम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus told, wise Vidura, fond of his own people, went back to Hastinapura with Yudhishthira's consent."}},{"n":18,"text":"तमब्रवीन्महाप्राज्ञं धृतराष्ट्रः प्रतापवान् ।\nदिष्ट्या प्राप्तोऽसि धर्मज्ञ दिष्ट्या स्मरसि मेऽनघ ॥","meaning":{"en":"Mighty Dhritarashtra said to the very wise Vidura, \"By good fortune you have come, knower of dharma; by good fortune you remember me, blameless one."}},{"n":19,"text":"अद्य रात्रौ दिवा चाहं त्वत्कृते भरतर्षभ ।\nप्रजागरे प्रपश्यामि विचित्रं देहमात्मनः ॥","meaning":{"en":"Today, night and day, bull of the Bharatas, I have lain sleepless on your account, seeing my own body as a strange thing.\""}},{"n":20,"text":"सोऽङ्कमादाय विदुरं मूर्ध्न्युपाघ्राय चैव ह ।\nक्षम्यतामिति चोवाच यदुक्तोऽसि मया रुषा ॥","meaning":{"en":"He took Vidura on his lap, smelled his head in greeting, and said, \"Forgive me for what I said to you in anger.\""}},{"text":"विदुर उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vidura said:"}},{"n":21,"text":"क्षान्तमेव मया राजन्गुरुर्नः परमो भवान् ।\nतथा ह्यस्म्यागतः क्षिप्रं त्वद्दर्शनपरायणः ॥","meaning":{"en":"I have already forgiven it, king; you are our highest elder. I came back quickly because I was eager to see you."}},{"n":22,"text":"भवन्ति हि नरव्याघ्र पुरुषा धर्मचेतसः ।\nदीनाभिपातिनो राजन्नात्र कार्या विचारणा ॥","meaning":{"en":"Tiger among men, those with a righteous mind rush to the afflicted; there is no need to wonder at it."}},{"n":23,"text":"पाण्डोः सुता यादृशा मे तादृशा मे सुतास्तव ।\nदीना इति हि मे बुद्धिरभिपन्नाद्य तान्प्रति ॥","meaning":{"en":"The sons of Pandu are as dear to me as your sons are. My mind is moved toward them today only because they are in distress."}},{"text":"वैशंपायन उवाच","meaning":{"en":"Vaishampayana said:"}},{"n":24,"text":"अन्योन्यमनुनीयैवं भ्रातरौ तौ महाद्युती ।\nविदुरो धृतराष्ट्रश्च लेभाते परमां मुदम् ॥","meaning":{"en":"Thus placating each other, the two brothers of great splendor, Vidura and Dhritarashtra, found the highest joy."}}]}]}